 CNSsolve>! * Copyright 2003-2018 Alexandre Bonvin, Utrecht University.           * 
 CNSsolve>! * Originally adapted from Aria 1.2 from Nilges and Linge, EMBL.       * 
 CNSsolve>! * All rights reserved.                                                * 
